  "additional_concerns": [
    "The executable answers only whether an applicable paragraph 14 demonstration request has been made. TRUE does not establish fulfilment, SFC satisfaction, smart-contract assurance, or compliance with paragraphs 10–13; FALSE does not extinguish confirmation or substantive duties.",
